<?php
return ['name' => 'attuned_gui_water_the_listener', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Attuned Gui Water – The Listener', 'zh' => '身弱癸水'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Gui Water is the element of gentle rain and dew. When attuned (with weaker energy), Attuned Gui Water\'s flow lacks force and needs nourishment and gathering to build influence. It excels at listening and empathizing, readily absorbing the information and feelings around it. Its ultimate lesson is the wisdom that \'dripping water can pierce stone\' – small, consistent acts can overcome the hardest challenges. Rather than chasing after roaring floods of power, it applies continuous, subtle effort. Over time, its quiet persistence can softly reconfigure the landscape, creating a lasting and irreplaceable impact.</p><p>Meticulous & Sensitive: Keenly observant and emotionally sensitive, you adapt to your surroundings with ease and notice details others might miss.<br/>Rational & Considerate: Outwardly gentle and accepting, you maintain an inner reserve. You carefully weigh pros and cons, though you must guard against over-analyzing choices.<br/>Gentle yet Steadfast: You have deep emotional needs and value security. Beneath your soft exterior lies a quiet tenacity – when it truly matters, you stand firm.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Metal and Water. Attuned Gui Water is like a delicate trickle that can lack assertiveness and presence. By harnessing supportive Metal and Water energies, you strengthen your decisiveness and mental agility. These elements give your actions clearer direction while helping you steadily grow your network and resources.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>You prosper from slow, steady growth rather than quick windfalls. Cultivate a specialized niche and avoid high-risk speculation. Working in partnership (for example, with a spouse or trusted business partner) can stabilize your finances and and lead to better long-term gains.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Pay attention to your kidney health by staying hydrated and avoiding excessive salt. Protect your joints and try not to linger in cold, damp environments for too long. Keep your hormones in balance by managing stress and not overworking yourself.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>You may sometimes feel a vague emptiness or nihilism creep in. Fight that stagnant feeling by keeping active and social. A regular exercise routine and frequent get-togethers with friends will keep your energy flowing and your spirits lifted.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Where You Flourish: Finance & Consulting: Banking, accounting, auditing, advisory consulting. Technology & IT: Data analysis, telecommunications engineering, artificial intelligence. Education & Media: Teaching, academic research, writing, editing, translating. Healthcare & Social Welfare: Therapy/counseling, social work, pharmacy, nursing, rehabilitation therapy. Where Energy Feels Drained: Construction & Geoscience: Civil engineering, real estate development, mining, geological exploration. Energy Industry: Power engineering, petrochemical fields. Legal & Military: Judge, prosecutor, police officer, soldier – highly regimented or combative roles may feel too rigid.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Geng Metal friends give you direction when you feel adrift. They help you organize scattered thoughts, boosting your confidence in making decisions and handling pressure.</li><li>Ren Water companions broaden your social horizons. They resonate with your vibe and can introduce you to new communities, expanding your circle.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Bing Fire partner is bright, positive, and responsible – the sunshine that chases away your clouds. Their warmth lifts your mood and helps dispel any gloom, giving you energy and optimism.</li><li>Xin Metal partner is detail-oriented and disciplined. They motivate you to act and help turn your inspired ideas into practical results, keeping you on track toward your goals.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Jackie Chan: International action film superstar known for his martial arts prowess and philanthropy</li><li>Tim Cook: CEO of Apple Inc., recognized for his leadership in tech and advocacy on social issues</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Wear metal accessories (like jewelry or watches) to amplify helpful Metal energy</li><li>Indulge in regular hot baths or visits to hot springs to relax and recharge</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Black & Blue (Water): Black symbolizes depth and blue brings calm clarity. These Water hues bolster your confidence and composure, helping Attuned Gui Water feel more assured under pressure. Incorporate black or blue in your wardrobe or decor for an extra dose of poise and peace.</li><li>White & Gold (Metal): White and gold represent clarity and brilliance. They sharpen your mind and lend you an edge, making decision-making quicker and more agile. Adding white or metallic gold accents to your environment – whether in clothing, accessories, or decor – can boost your efficiency and mental spark.</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>North (Water): Represents inspiration and wisdom. Facing north enhances your creativity and insight, allowing you to be more forward-thinking in your ideas and actions.</li><li>West (Metal): Represents helpful allies and support. Facing west invites benefactor energy and expands your connections, smoothing your path and attracting valuable opportunities.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>癸水为雨露之水，身弱则流动性不足，需要滋养与汇聚，才能发挥影响力。它善于倾听、共情，并能够接纳和吸纳周围信息。身弱癸水的终极修炼在于领悟\'水滴石穿\'的智慧，不追求汹涌之势，而是以持续而细微的力量，悄然改写现实格局，发挥持久而不可替代的价值。</p><p>细腻敏感：心思细腻敏感，洞察力强，适应环境灵活。<br/>理性周全：外显柔和包容，内在有疏离感，遇事善于权衡利弊，但需警惕过度纠结而停滞不前。<br/>柔韧坚守：情感需求深刻，对安全感要求高，关键时刻能展现柔韧中的坚持。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身弱癸水，喜用神为金、水。癸水如细流涓涓，身弱时力量不足，容易缺乏果断与气场。若能借助金水之力，就能增强决断力与思维活跃度，让行动更有方向感，同时稳健拓展人际与资源。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>适宜细水长流型收益，深耕垂直领域，避免杠杆投机，借助配偶或合作伙伴稳固财富，适合合作生财。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>注意肾脏健康，避免摄入过多盐分；保护关节，不要长时间呆在阴冷环境；调节内分泌。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>易陷入虚无感，需通过规律运动、高频社交保持能量流动。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：金融与咨询业：银行业、会计、审计、咨询顾问。科技与信息业：数据分析、通信工程、人工智能。教育文化与传媒业：教师、研究员、作家、编辑、翻译。医疗与社会福利业：心理咨询师、社工、药剂师、护理、康复治疗。慎重行业：建筑与地产业：土木工程、房地产开发、矿山开采、地质勘探。能源行业：电力工程、石油化工。司法与军警业：法官、检察官、警察、军人。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>庚金：庚金能为你提供方向性指引，帮助你厘清混乱思绪，增强决策力和抗压能力。</li><li>壬水：壬水能够拓展你的社交圈。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>丙火：丙火伴侣阳光积极、责任感强，能够驱散你的阴雨气质。</li><li>辛金：辛金伴侣注重细节，善于规划。能够鞭策你，帮助你将灵感落地为实际成果。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Jackie Chan：国际动作巨星</li><li>Tim Cook：苹果公司CEO</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>三毛：知名作家，融合游记、散文与小说，开创华语文学\'流浪叙事\'风格</li><li>张艺谋：中国电影国际化的开拓者，以视觉美学传递东方文化精神</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>佩戴金属饰品</li><li>多泡澡/泡温泉</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>黑色 / 蓝色（水）：黑色象征深邃，蓝色带来冷静与理性，能增强决断力与气场，让癸水在关键时刻更自信从容。日常多用黑蓝色小物件，让行动更有底气。</li><li>白色 / 金色（金）：白色与金色象征清晰与锋芒，能提升思维活跃度，让癸水在思考与决策中更敏捷。适度融入白金色元素，使行动更高效。</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>北方（水）：北方的能量象征灵感与智慧，能增强创造力，让癸水在思维与行动中更具前瞻性。</li><li>西方（金）：西方的能量象征贵人运与支持，能帮助癸水拓展人脉与资源，让行动更顺畅、机会更多。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
